ut have the same linear growth order."],["text","3. For f(n)=3n+7, both upper and lower linear bounds hold for sufficiently large n."],["heading","INTERVIEW MEMORY TIP"],["text","Theta(n) is tight; O(n) alone is an upper bound, not necessarily a worst-case label."]]